sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a Local Authorization list<br>to the Charging Station with type full and without<br>AuthorizationData elements in the message

    loop Repeated if the Local Authorization List is too big for one message
        CSMS->>CS: SendLocalListRequest (updateType = Full, localAuthorizationList = <Empty>)
        Note over CSMS: Validation: Message SendLocalListRequest<br>- updateType Full<br>- localAuthorizationList <Empty>
        CS-->>CSMS: SendLocalListResponse (status = Accepted)
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
